{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108600","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1510860001:1":{"text":"루, 내가 무언가를 잊어버린 것 같아... 아주 중요한 일 같은데.","source_cn":"露，我好像忘记了什么事……是一件很重要的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FB6A99355DF4A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510860002:1":{"text":"우리가 함께하는 것보다 더 중요한 일이 어디 있어?","source_cn":"还有什么事比我们在一起更重要呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E7D992EC24AA758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510860003:1":{"text":"아니... 분명...","source_cn":"不……我明明记得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72EF0067748539A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510860004:1":{"text":"아, 전장! 보칼리스와 아쿠보르의 전쟁이 아직 끝나지 않은 데다, 사냥의 신까지 강림했으니... 난 여기 있을 수 없어!","source_cn":"啊，战场！对了！呼临和雅库伯尔的战争还没结束，狩猎神也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C196B75363331B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510860005:1":{"text":"페르세우스, 너 취했구나? 그건 이미 해결됐어.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，你喝醉了。那些事情早都已经解决了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD543B8D5292BEF25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510860006:1":{"text":"해결됐다고?","source_cn":"解决了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DFA617E4201DB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510860007:1":{"text":"응. 오르파가 님께서 <style=\"highlight\">보칼리스로 군대를 보내지 않겠다고</style> 하셨어. 그리고 보칼리스가 겪고 있는 기근을 도와주기 위해 아쿠보르의 고기까지 제공하라고 하셨는걸.","source_cn":"是啊。奥法迦大人已经答应<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FDC2A0A5112E5BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510860008:1":{"text":"모든 건 다 해결됐어. 이제 넌 여기서 나와 함께 있으면 돼.","source_cn":"一切都过去了，现在，你只需要留在这里陪我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E8EE1F6015C7773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510860009:1":{"text":"그럴 리가... 사냥의 신이 호의를 베풀었다고?","source_cn":"怎么可能……狩猎神会这么好心？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39255DD55FB7E3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510860010:1":{"text":"난 사냥의 신을 모시기 위해 내 목숨을 바쳤어. 그러니 이건 나에게 주는 보상이기도 해.","source_cn":"为了侍奉狩猎神，我献出了自己的生命，这是她对我的奖赏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31D63441DC6CD5DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510860011:1":{"text":"루, 너...","source_cn":"露，你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE295B18E9DC65856","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510860012:1":{"text":"내 말을 못 믿겠다는 거야?","source_cn":"你不信我的话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142C97CB83BBDF9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510860013:1":{"text":"한 잔 더 마셔. 넌 지금 너무 긴장했어. 사냥의 신은 절대 인간을 해치지 않아. <style=\"highlight\">내가 약속할게</style>.","source_cn":"再喝一杯吧，你太紧张了。狩猎神绝对不会伤害人类，<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59D99CE06FE5A709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510860014:1":{"text":"루...\n알겠어... 널 믿을게.","source_cn":"露……\\n好……我相信你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FAB93A12E3739E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510860015:1":{"text":"그래, 날 믿어.","source_cn":"没错，相信我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x586B03D6C6AFC418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510860016:1":{"text":"우습기 짝이 없네. 고작 몇 마디 말에 그걸 믿는다고? 이게 사랑이라는 거야?","source_cn":"可笑。这么两句话就相信了，这就是爱情？","status":"matc